description:
`later` is added as a suggested package because it is used to run the event loop in `http_server`. However, nowhere does `later` get checked for as an installed package. 

https://github.com/r-lib/nanonext/blob/9d32d058ae03e7bc51d72e1f61a7694923c63b65/R/server.R#L138

I think changing the function signature to: 

```r
run_event_loop <- function(timeout = Inf) {
  if (!requireNamespace("later")) {
    stop("The package \"later\" is required to run the event loop.")
  }
  later::run_now(timeout / 1000)
}
```

would resolve this.
